# The Rust API. Server-side only — never prefix this NEXT_PUBLIC_, the browser
# must not learn the backend's address.
AGENTCOUNT_API_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Where the "get each census report by email" form POSTs — a hosted list
# provider's subscribe endpoint, e.g.
#   https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/<your-list>
#
# Unset, the form does not render at all. That is on purpose: a form that
# silently posts nowhere is worse than no form, because a reader believes they
# subscribed and finds out otherwise when the report never arrives.
#
# No address ever reaches this project — the browser posts straight to the
# provider, so there is nothing here to leak and no unsubscribe flow of ours
# to get wrong. Server-side only; the value is not secret, but there is no
# reason for the browser to hold it before the form is rendered.
NEWSLETTER_ACTION=
